  "title": "Create credential"
 },
 "description": "Create and persist one credential as an additive write. First call n8n_credentials_schema with the planned type, then build data from its field contract; name is only the stored label. isResolvable is forwarded only when supplied. Use n8n_credentials_update for an existing credential. Requires write/unsafe mode plus create permission. Secret values belong only in data input and are excluded from logs and output; returns metadata only.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
